{"4037130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WRONG WAY", "steam_appid": 4037130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up in an unknown place. Darkness surrounds you, and your only allies are the objects scattered throughout the mysterious rooms. Every vase, every book, every seemingly ordinary item hides secrets that may reveal the path to your freedom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRONG WAY is not just a game – it’s a psychological experience where every decision matters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEEP EXPLORATION</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate over 20 types of interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden notes that gradually unveil the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve complex puzzles using logic and keen observation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INGENIOUS PUZZLES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keypad systems with encrypted codes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine objects to unlock new areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room conceals clues leading to the next one</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant tension without cheap jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive atmosphere built through subtle details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that unfolds gradually through the environment</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up in an unknown place. Darkness surrounds you, and your only allies are the objects scattered throughout the mysterious rooms. Every vase, every book, every seemingly ordinary item hides secrets that may reveal the path to your freedom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRO